# RDF Unreleased Release Notes

## Unreleased

-- New Features --

[New] rdf tokens reports cache rebuilds: turns after an idle gap past the cache TTL (5 min, or
      1 h when the turn's 1h writes exceed its 5m writes) that rewrite at least half of a 50K+
      token context, costed as the write price minus a cache read; --json adds a rebuilds object,
      --summary rebuild_events and rebuild_cost_usd, and the text report a cache rebuilds line

-- Bug Fixes --

[Fix] docs site: the 3.9.1 em dash sweep left an unquoted colon in docs/_config.yml, so Pages
      builds failed from 3.9.1 on; the description is quoted again
